+## 測試與證據
+
+原 14 組：none、wrong-create、duplicate-name、duplicate-source、partial-insert、peer-payload、noop-index、bad-dpi、reopen-type、reopen-payload、reopen-nan、reopen-printer、reopen-margin、reopen-dpi。
